l hub and gateway to the West Coast National Park.\\\"},{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"swellendam\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Swellendam\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"Overberg · historic Cape\\\",\\\"district\\\":\\\"Overberg\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ghost\\\",\\\"render_pct\\\":0,\\\"opportunity_potential\\\":38,\\\"heritage\\\":true,\\\"coordinator_status\\\":\\\"recruiting\\\",\\\"route\\\":\\\"/town/swellendam\\\",\\\"illustrative\\\":true,\\\"lat\\\":-34.0237,\\\"lng\\\":20.4524,\\\"description\\\":\\\"One of the oldest towns in South Africa, Swellendam is a heritage gem with perfectly preserved Cape Dutch buildings, art galleries, and the annual Berry Festival. The Bontebok National Park nearby protects one of the rarest antelope species on earth.\\\",\\\"population_estimate\\\":8000,\\\"archetype\\\":\\\"heritage_town\\\"},{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"grabouw\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Grabouw\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"Overberg · Elgin apples\\\",\\\"district\\\":\\\"Overberg\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ghost\\\",\\\"render_pct\\\":0,\\\"opportunity_potential\\\":36,\\\"heritage\\\":false,\\\"coordinator_status\\\":\\\"recruiting\\\",\\\"route\\\":\\\"/town/grabouw\\\",\\\"illustrative\\\":true,\\\"lat\\\":-34.15,\\\"lng\\\":19.0333,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Apple capital of South Africa in the Elgin Valley, surrounded by orchards and cool-climate vineyards.\\\"},{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"robertson\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Robertson\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"Cape Winelands · wine \\u0026 roses\\\",\\\"district\\\":\\\"Cape Winelands\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ghost\\\",\\\"render_pct\\\":0,\\\"opportunity_potential\\\":34,\\\"heritage\\\":true,\\\"coordinator_status\\\":\\\"recruiting\\\",\\\"route\\\":\\\"/town/robertson\\\",\\\"illustrative\\\":true,\\\"lat\\\":-33.8,\\\"lng\\\":19.8833,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Wine and roses town in the Breede River Valley, heart of the Robertson Wine Route.\\\"},{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"malmesbury\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Malmesbury\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"West Coast · Swartland wheat\\\",\\\"district\\\":\\